<title>USA: Pennzoil returns takeover arena as a target.</title>
<headline>Pennzoil returns takeover arena as a target.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pennzoil Co, facing an unwelcome $6.4 billion raid announced Monday by Union Pacific Resources Group Inc, returns to the takeover spotlight nine years after a historic brawl with Texaco Inc over Getty Oil Co.</p>
<p>In 1988, Texaco paid Pennzoil $3 billion to settle a legal battle initiated after Pennzoil claimed Texaco interfered with its January 1984 pact to buy three-sevenths of Getty, according to a history of the case obtained from Pennzoil.</p>
</text>
